## FFmpeg / FFprobe

- **Project:** https://ffmpeg.org
- **License:** LGPL v2.1+ (if built without `--enable-gpl`) or GPL v2+ (if built with GPL-licensed components enabled)
- **Used as:** bundled standalone executables (`ffmpeg.exe`, `ffprobe.exe`), invoked as external processes. Not statically linked into this app's code.

FFmpeg is a trademark of Fabrice Bellard, originator of the FFmpeg project. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the FFmpeg project.

**Build note:** this app should be distributed with an **LGPL-only** FFmpeg build (no `--enable-gpl` codecs) to avoid the combined distribution being subject to GPL terms. If you swap in a GPL build, review GPL compliance obligations before redistributing.

Full license text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html (or https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html for GPL builds)

